                            	   708: UpdateBlock_JumpTable:
02:00039F92 00039F9E        	   709:     dc.l    UpdateBlock0Idle   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:00039F96 0003A088        	   710:     dc.l    UpdateBlock1Moving   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
