                            	  7808: L17295_Exit:
02:00044BF6 4E75            	  7809:     rts
                            	  7810: 
                            	  7811: ; Indexed by reverse direction index.
                            	  7812: ;
                            	  7813: ; Is used in mapping a direction to a mask for its axis.
                            	  7814: ; For example:
                            	  7815: ; - right masks off up and down
                            	  7816: ; - up masks off left and right
                            	  7817: ;
